IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DATAS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
77 STANDALONE  PIC 9 VALUE 1.
01 REC.
   05 REC-NAME     PIC X(20).
   05 REC-AMT      PIC S9(7)V99 USAGE IS PACKED-DECIMAL.
   05 REC-EDIT     PIC -ZZ,ZZ9.99.
   05 REC-DATE.
      10 REC-YY    PIC 99.
      10 REC-MM    PIC 99.
      10 REC-DD    PIC 99.
   05 FILLER       PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
   05 REC-FLAG     PIC X JUSTIFIED RIGHT.
   05 REC-NUM      PIC 9(4) BINARY.
   05 REC-IDX      USAGE INDEX.
   05 REC-PTR      USAGE POINTER.
   05 REC-SIGN     PIC S9(3) SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE CHARACTER.
   05 REC-Z        PIC 9(4) BLANK WHEN ZERO.
66 REC-DATES RENAMES REC-YY THRU REC-DD.
01 CONSTANTS.
   05 MSG-1        PIC X(10) VALUE "HELLO".
   05 MSG-2        PIC X(10) VALUE ALL "*".
   05 LIM          PIC 9(3)  VALUE 100.
   05 LOW-V        PIC X     VALUE LOW-VALUES.
   05 FLT          COMP-2.
   05 SIGNED-V     PIC S9(3)V9(2) VALUE -12.5.
   05 SIXTEEN      PIC 9(2)  VALUE 1.5E1.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "A" TO REC-FLAG
    MOVE CORRESPONDING REC TO CONSTANTS
    MOVE ZEROES TO REC-NUM
    MOVE SPACES TO REC-NAME
    MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO MSG-1
    SET REC-IDX TO 1
    STOP RUN.
